{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ9axtZCTQjUoinUEW1a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E3ZqioJ2EkBzaMkZa8mGgk","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-028-1stzt5/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>理财新手先搞懂这 3 个词</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <header class=\"head\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">理财入门 · 第 1 课</span>\n      <h1>理财新手<br>先搞懂这 <em>3</em> 个词</h1>\n      <p class=\"sub\">看懂它们，才不会被“高收益”忽悠</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <h2>复利 <span>钱生钱，利滚利</span></h2>\n        <p>赚到的收益不取出，继续投入下一轮，一起生息。</p>\n        <div class=\"eg\">\n          <b>1 万元 · 年化 5% · 10 年</b>\n          <div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:61%\"></i><label>单利 ≈ 1.50 万</label></div>\n          <div class=\"bar hot\"><i style=\"width:67%\"></i><label>复利 ≈ 1.63 万</label></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <h2>年化收益率 <span>换算成“一年”的收益</span></h2>\n        <p>不同期限的产品，统一按一年来比较才公平。</p>\n        <div class=\"eg\">\n          <b>3 个月赚 1%</b> ≈ 年化 <strong>4%</strong><br>\n          <small>⚠️ 年化 ≠ 你一定能拿到的钱，要看实际持有天数</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <h2>流动性 <span>多快能把钱取出来</span></h2>\n        <p>越容易随时变现，流动性越好，通常收益也越低。</p>\n        <div class=\"eg scale\">\n          <span>活期 / 货币基金</span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span><span>定期 / 理财</span><span class=\"arrow\">→</span><span>房产</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"foot\">\n      <p>💡 口诀：<b>收益、风险、流动性</b>，三者不可兼得</p>\n      <span>收藏备用 ⭐ 不构成投资建议</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2305,"cache_read_input_tokens":31725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2305},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b4a002cd-2dc6-4a6e-b3c5-3fa724be4a8f","uuid":"8b79c7fe-2bb6-41bf-8802-f487882b2777","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:36:21.889Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ9aw4BHm1ws2L4ekDvm","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01E3ZqioJ2EkBzaMkZa8mGgk":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-028-1stzt5/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>理财新手先搞懂这 3 个词</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <header class=\"head\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">理财入门 · 第 1 课</span>\n      <h1>理财新手<br>先搞懂这 <em>3</em> 个词</h1>\n      <p class=\"sub\">看懂它们，才不会被“高收益”忽悠</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <h2>复利 <span>钱生钱，利滚利</span></h2>\n        <p>赚到的收益不取出，继续投入下一轮，一起生息。</p>\n        <div class=\"eg\">\n          <b>1 万元 · 年化 5% · 10 年</b>\n          <div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:61%\"></i><label>单利 ≈ 1.50 万</label></div>\n          <div class=\"bar hot\"><i style=\"width:67%\"></i><label>复利 ≈ 1.63 万</label></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <h2>年化收益率 <span>换算成“一年”的收益</span></h2>\n        <p>不同期限的产品，统一按一年来比较才公